state, with a 30% increase in inventory compared to the previous year. To attract buyers, consider pricing your home competitively and ensuring it stands out in a more competitive market. Be prepared for homes to stay on the market longer, which may require flexibility in negotiations."}}', '68f7ba700c034964bff71d89', '2025-10-21T16:53:04.340000', '2025-10-21T16:53:04.340000', '68d6e7ac7b4452820eb29289', 'yogiandyoli@protonmail.com', FALSE);
